             <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/ContractualDefinitionsEnum#ISDA2003CreditDerivatives>
             <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/ContractualDefinitionsEnum#ISDA2004Novation>
             <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/ContractualDefinitionsEnum#ISDA2005Commodity>
             <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/ContractualDefinitionsEnum#ISDA2006>
             <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/ContractualDefinitionsEnum#ISDA2006InflationDerivatives>
             <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/ContractualDefinitionsEnum#ISDA2008InflationDerivatives>
             <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/ContractualDefinitionsEnum#ISDA2011EquityDerivatives>
             <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/ContractualDefinitionsEnum#ISDA2014CreditDerivatives>
