             <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/AncillaryRoleEnum#ExerciseNoticeReceiverPartyCancelableProvision>
             <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/AncillaryRoleEnum#ExerciseNoticeReceiverPartyExtendibleProvision>
             <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/AncillaryRoleEnum#CalculationAgentIndependent>
             <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/AncillaryRoleEnum#CalculationAgentOptionalEarlyTermination>
