             <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/ValuationMethodEnum#Highest>
             <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/ValuationMethodEnum#AverageMarket>
             <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/ValuationMethodEnum#AverageHighest>
